{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to paths.json to point this server at different bulk data.",
    "Every key is optional; anything omitted falls back to the hardcoded default.",
    "",
    "Precedence: a tool argument, then the environment variable, then this file,",
    "then the default. Prefer THIS FILE over the environment variable when a",
    "standard MCP client launches the server — such a client forwards only HOME,",
    "LOGNAME, PATH, SHELL and USER, so an exported variable never arrives.",
    "",
    "Run `python3 src/paths.py` to see what currently resolves, from where,",
    "and any warnings about it."
  ],

